---- MODULE ProfileLoadTrace ----
\* Trace validation: replays runs of the real fx binary through ProfileLoad's
\* own actions.
\*
\* ProfileLoadObserved is generated by tests/tla/drivers/mcp_config/driver.ts.
\* It defines Observed, a sequence of records [file, loaded, noted]: the
\* entries of one profile mcp.json in the file's order, and per surface the
\* entries fx ran (`fx mcp list --json` for the CLI, the servers named in the
\* first model request of an ACP session with profileMcpServers) and the
\* entries it named as skipped (a note on stderr, a trace line in ACP).
\*
\* Each surface reads the file in its order, the CLI first: fx reads a file's
\* entries in order, and the order doesn't change what either surface ends
\* with unless reading stops early, which the model allows in any order.
\* Observations are replayed in turn. The index k advances only when both
\* surfaces have read the file and ended exactly as observed. The run is
\* ACCEPTED when TLC violates NotAllMatched, which is reachable only after
\* every observation matched. A completed search means REJECTED.
EXTENDS ProfileLoad, ProfileLoadObserved

VARIABLE k
traceVars == <<vars, k>>

TraceInit == k = 1 /\ InitWith(Observed[1].file)

\* The surface reading now, and the next entry it reads.
Current == IF ~Ended("cli") THEN "cli" ELSE "acp"
First(set) == CHOOSE e \in set : \A other \in set : e <= other

Step ==
    /\ k <= Len(Observed)
    /\ ~Ended(Current)
    /\ \/ Finish(Current)
       \/ todo[Current] # {} /\ Read(Current, First(todo[Current]))
    /\ UNCHANGED k

Matches(o) ==
    /\ \A s \in Surfaces : Ended(s)
    /\ loaded = o.loaded
    /\ noted = o.noted

Reset(f) ==
    /\ file' = f
    /\ todo' = [s \in Surfaces |-> DOMAIN f]
    /\ loaded' = [s \in Surfaces |-> {}]
    /\ skipped' = [s \in Surfaces |-> {}]
    /\ noted' = [s \in Surfaces |-> {}]
    /\ phase' = [s \in Surfaces |-> "reading"]

Advance ==
    /\ k <= Len(Observed)
    /\ Matches(Observed[k])
    /\ k' = k + 1
    /\ IF k + 1 <= Len(Observed) THEN Reset(Observed[k + 1].file) ELSE UNCHANGED vars

TraceSpec == TraceInit /\ [][Step \/ Advance]_traceVars

\* Sentinel: violated exactly when every observation matched.
NotAllMatched == k <= Len(Observed)
====
